config BR2_PACKAGE_RELICOS_JOYPAD
	bool "relicos-joypad"
	help
	  RelicOS input fusion daemon (M14). The R36S's gamepad is two
	  evdev devices on mainline drivers (gpio-keys: 17 buttons,
	  adc-joystick: 4 axes) and RetroArch binds one device per port.
	  This daemon grabs both and re-emits every event through one
	  uinput device, "RelicOS Gamepad". Needs CONFIG_INPUT_UINPUT
	  in the kernel (board/r36s/linux.fragment). No dependencies:
	  plain C on the libc.
